<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex29.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathop{\leq}\limits^{\text{(a)}}\frac{\eta_{n}}{2}\sum_{m\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}w_{n,m}\left\|\mathbf{G}_{m,t-\tau_{n,m}}^{n}\right\|^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover><mo movablelimits="false">≤</mo><mtext>(a)</mtext></mover><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐆</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathop{\leq}\limits^{\text{(a)}}\frac{\eta_{n}}{2}\sum_{m\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}w_{n,m}\left\|\mathbf{G}_{m,t-\tau_{n,m}}^{n}\right\|^{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex30"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex30.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002pt+\frac{\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,t}-\mathbf{U}_{n,t}\right\|^{2}-\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,t+1}-\mathbf{U}_{n,t}\right\|^{2}}{2\eta_{n}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002pt+\frac{\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,t}-\mathbf{U}_{n,t}\right\|^{2}-\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,t+1}-\mathbf{U}_{n,t}\right\|^{2}}{2\eta_{n}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex31"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex31.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathop{\leq}\limits^{\text{(b)}}\left(\sum_{m\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}w_{n,m}G_{m}^{2}\right)\frac{\eta_{n}}{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover><mo movablelimits="false">≤</mo><mtext>(b)</mtext></mover><mrow><mrow><mo lspace="0em">(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>G</mi><mi>m</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathop{\leq}\limits^{\text{(b)}}\left(\sum_{m\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}w_{n,m}G_{m}^{2}\right)\frac{\eta_{n}}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex32"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex32.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002pt+\frac{\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,t}-\mathbf{U}_{n,t}\right\|^{2}-\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,t+1}-\mathbf{U}_{n,t}\right\|^{2}}{2\eta_{n}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002pt+\frac{\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,t}-\mathbf{U}_{n,t}\right\|^{2}-\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,t+1}-\mathbf{U}_{n,t}\right\|^{2}}{2\eta_{n}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.Ex33"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.Ex33.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathop{\leq}\limits^{\text{(c)}}K_{n}\left(\sum_{m\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}G_{m}\right)\frac{\eta_{n}}{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover><mo movablelimits="false">≤</mo><mtext>(c)</mtext></mover><mrow><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathop{\leq}\limits^{\text{(c)}}K_{n}\left(\sum_{m\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}G_{m}\right)\frac{\eta_{n}}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A1.E2"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A1.E2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002pt+\frac{\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,t}-\mathbf{U}_{n,t}\right\|^{2}-\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,t+1}-\mathbf{U}_{n,t}\right\|^{2}}{2\eta_{n}}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002pt+\frac{\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,t}-\mathbf{U}_{n,t}\right\|^{2}-\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,t+1}-\mathbf{U}_{n,t}\right\|^{2}}{2\eta_{n}},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(A-2)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A1.p2.2" class="ltx_p">where (a) follows from Jensen’s inequality, (b) from the bounded gradient assumption, and (c) from the definition of <math id="A1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K_{n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K_{n}</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A2" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix B </span>Proof of Theorem <a href="#Thmtheorem4" title="Theorem 4. ‣ Proof: ‣ V-B1 Bounding 𝚁𝚎𝚐^⋆ ‣ V-B Bounding Individual Terms ‣ V Theoretical Analysis ‣ Distributed Dynamic Associative Memory via Online Convex Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a></h2>

<div id="A2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">It follows</p>
<table id="A2.EGx12" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex34"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex34.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{t=\tau_{n,\min}+1}^{T+\tau_{n,\max}}\frac{\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,t}-\mathbf{U}_{n,t}\right\|^{2}-\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,t+1}-\mathbf{U}_{n,t}\right\|^{2}}{2\eta_{n}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>min</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>max</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{t=\tau_{n,\min}+1}^{T+\tau_{n,\max}}\frac{\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,t}-\mathbf{U}_{n,t}\right\|^{2}-\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,t+1}-\mathbf{U}_{n,t}\right\|^{2}}{2\eta_{n}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex35"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex35.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{t=\tau_{n,\min}+1}^{T+\tau_{n,\max}}\frac{\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,t}\right\|^{2}-\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,t+1}\right\|^{2}}{2\eta_{n}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>min</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>max</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{t=\tau_{n,\min}+1}^{T+\tau_{n,\max}}\frac{\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,t}\right\|^{2}-\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,t+1}\right\|^{2}}{2\eta_{n}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.E1"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E1.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002pt+\sum_{t=\tau_{n,\min}+1}^{T+\tau_{n,\max}}\frac{\left\langle\mathbf{U}_{n,t},\mathbf{X}_{n,t+1}\right\rangle-\left\langle\mathbf{U}_{n,t},\mathbf{X}_{n,t}\right\rangle}{\eta_{n}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>min</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>max</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msup><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow></mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002pt+\sum_{t=\tau_{n,\min}+1}^{T+\tau_{n,\max}}\frac{\left\langle\mathbf{U}_{n,t},\mathbf{X}_{n,t+1}\right\rangle-\left\langle\mathbf{U}_{n,t},\mathbf{X}_{n,t}\right\rangle}{\eta_{n}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(B-1)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">For the first term in (<a href="#A2.E1" title="In Appendix B Proof of Theorem ‣ Distributed Dynamic Associative Memory via Online Convex Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B-1</span></a>), we have</p>
<table id="A2.EGx13" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex36"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex36.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{t=\tau_{n,\min}+1}^{T+\tau_{n,\max}}\frac{\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,t}\right\|^{2}-\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,t+1}\right\|^{2}}{2\eta_{n}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>min</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>max</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{t=\tau_{n,\min}+1}^{T+\tau_{n,\max}}\frac{\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,t}\right\|^{2}-\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,t+1}\right\|^{2}}{2\eta_{n}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex37"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex37.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\frac{\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,\tau_{n,\min}+1}\right\|^{2}}{2\eta_{n}}-\frac{\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,T+{\tau_{n,\max+1}}}\right\|^{2}}{2\eta_{n}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>min</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo lspace="0em">+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\frac{\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,\tau_{n,\min}+1}\right\|^{2}}{2\eta_{n}}-\frac{\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,T+{\tau_{n,\max+1}}}\right\|^{2}}{2\eta_{n}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.E2"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\frac{B^{2}}{2\eta_{n}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\frac{B^{2}}{2\eta_{n}}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(B-2)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A2.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p3.1" class="ltx_p">For the second term in (<a href="#A2.E1" title="In Appendix B Proof of Theorem ‣ Distributed Dynamic Associative Memory via Online Convex Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B-1</span></a>), we have</p>
<table id="A2.EGx14" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A2.Ex38"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex38.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{t=\tau_{n,\min}+1}^{T+\tau_{n,\max}}\frac{\left\langle\mathbf{U}_{n,t},\mathbf{X}_{n,t+1}\right\rangle-\left\langle\mathbf{U}_{n,t},\mathbf{X}_{n,t}\right\rangle}{\eta_{n}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>min</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>max</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow></mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{t=\tau_{n,\min}+1}^{T+\tau_{n,\max}}\frac{\left\langle\mathbf{U}_{n,t},\mathbf{X}_{n,t+1}\right\rangle-\left\langle\mathbf{U}_{n,t},\mathbf{X}_{n,t}\right\rangle}{\eta_{n}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex39"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex39.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{t=\tau_{n,\min}+2}^{T+\tau_{n,\max}}\frac{\left\langle\mathbf{U}_{n,t-1}-\mathbf{U}_{n,t},\mathbf{X}_{n,t}\right\rangle}{\eta_{n}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>min</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>max</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{t=\tau_{n,\min}+2}^{T+\tau_{n,\max}}\frac{\left\langle\mathbf{U}_{n,t-1}-\mathbf{U}_{n,t},\mathbf{X}_{n,t}\right\rangle}{\eta_{n}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex40"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex40.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002pt+\frac{\left\langle\mathbf{U}_{n,T+\tau_{n,\max}},\mathbf{X}_{n,T+\tau_{n,\max}+1}\right\rangle}{\eta_{n}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>max</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>max</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002pt+\frac{\left\langle\mathbf{U}_{n,T+\tau_{n,\max}},\mathbf{X}_{n,T+\tau_{n,\max}+1}\right\rangle}{\eta_{n}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex41"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex41.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002pt-\frac{\left\langle\mathbf{U}_{n,\tau_{n,\min}+1},\mathbf{X}_{n,\tau_{n,\min}+1}\right\rangle}{\eta_{n}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>min</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>min</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>⟩</mo></mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002pt-\frac{\left\langle\mathbf{U}_{n,\tau_{n,\min}+1},\mathbf{X}_{n,\tau_{n,\min}+1}\right\rangle}{\eta_{n}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.Ex42"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.Ex42.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq B\frac{\sum_{t=\tau_{n,\min}+2}^{T+\tau_{n,\max}}\left\|\mathbf{U}_{n,t-1}-\mathbf{U}_{n,t}\right\|}{\eta_{n}}+\frac{B^{2}}{4\eta_{n}}+\frac{B^{2}}{\eta_{n}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>min</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>max</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mo lspace="0em">‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq B\frac{\sum_{t=\tau_{n,\min}+2}^{T+\tau_{n,\max}}\left\|\mathbf{U}_{n,t-1}-\mathbf{U}_{n,t}\right\|}{\eta_{n}}+\frac{B^{2}}{4\eta_{n}}+\frac{B^{2}}{\eta_{n}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A2.E3"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A2.E3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\frac{B}{\eta_{n}}\mathrm{PL}_{n}^{T+\tau_{n,\max}}+\frac{5B^{2}}{4\eta_{n}}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mi>B</mi><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>PL</mi><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>max</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\frac{B}{\eta_{n}}\mathrm{PL}_{n}^{T+\tau_{n,\max}}+\frac{5B^{2}}{4\eta_{n}},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(B-3)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A2.p3.2" class="ltx_p">with the first inequality in (<a href="#A2.E3" title="In Appendix B Proof of Theorem ‣ Distributed Dynamic Associative Memory via Online Convex Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B-3</span></a>) following from <math id="A2.p3.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="-B^{2}/4\leq\left\langle\mathbf{X},\mathbf{Y}\right\rangle\leq B^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>/</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mo>⟨</mo><mi>𝐗</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>𝐘</mi><mo>⟩</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-B^{2}/4\leq\left\langle\mathbf{X},\mathbf{Y}\right\rangle\leq B^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib23" title="" class="ltx_ref">23</a>, Appendix A]</cite>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A2.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.p4.1" class="ltx_p">Combining the above results completes the proof.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Proof of Bound on <math id="A3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathtt{Drift}_{\mathbf{X}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝙳𝚛𝚒𝚏𝚝</mi><mi>𝐗</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathtt{Drift}_{\mathbf{X}}</annotation></semantics></math></h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Unrolling the difference <math id="A3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{X}_{n,t}-\mathbf{X}_{n,t-\tau_{n,m}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{X}_{n,t}-\mathbf{X}_{n,t-\tau_{n,m}}</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t&gt;\tau_{n,m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t&gt;\tau_{n,m}</annotation></semantics></math> and from the update rule (<a href="#S4.E14" title="In IV-A DDAM-TOGD ‣ IV Distributed Dynamic Associative Memory via Tree-based Online Gradient Descent ‣ Distributed Dynamic Associative Memory via Online Convex Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">14</span></a>), it holds</p>
<table id="A3.EGx15" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.E1"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,t}-\mathbf{X}_{n,t-\tau_{n,m}}\right\|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,t}-\mathbf{X}_{n,t-\tau_{n,m}}\right\|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(C-1)</span></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex43"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex43.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\left\|\sum_{j=1}^{\tau_{n,m}}(\mathbf{X}_{n,t-j+1}-\mathbf{X}_{n,t-j})\right\|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\left\|\sum_{j=1}^{\tau_{n,m}}(\mathbf{X}_{n,t-j+1}-\mathbf{X}_{n,t-j})\right\|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex44"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex44.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathop{\leq}\limits^{\text{(a)}}\sum_{j=1}^{\tau_{n,m}}\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,t-j+1}-\mathbf{X}_{n,t-j}\right\|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover><mo movablelimits="false">≤</mo><mtext>(a)</mtext></mover><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐗</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathop{\leq}\limits^{\text{(a)}}\sum_{j=1}^{\tau_{n,m}}\left\|\mathbf{X}_{n,t-j+1}-\mathbf{X}_{n,t-j}\right\|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex45"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex45.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\mathop{\leq}\limits^{\text{(b)}}\eta_{n}\sum_{j=1}^{\tau_{n,m}}\left\|\sum_{s\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}w_{n,s}\mathbf{G}_{s,t-j-\tau_{n,s}}^{n}\mathbbm{1}_{\{t-j&gt;\tau_{n,s}\}}\right\|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover><mo movablelimits="false">≤</mo><mtext>(b)</mtext></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><msubsup><mi>𝐆</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><msub><mn>𝟙</mn><mrow><mo maxsize="1.140em" minsize="1.140em">{</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>τ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo maxsize="1.140em" minsize="1.140em">}</mo></mrow></msub><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathop{\leq}\limits^{\text{(b)}}\eta_{n}\sum_{j=1}^{\tau_{n,m}}\left\|\sum_{s\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}w_{n,s}\mathbf{G}_{s,t-j-\tau_{n,s}}^{n}\mathbbm{1}_{\{t-j&gt;\tau_{n,s}\}}\right\|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex46"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex46.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\mathop{\leq}\limits^{\text{(c)}}\eta_{n}\sum_{j=1}^{\tau_{n,m}}\sum_{s\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}w_{n,s}\left\|\mathbf{G}_{s,t-j-\tau_{n,s}}^{n}\right\|\mathbbm{1}_{\{t-j&gt;\tau_{n,s}\}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover><mo movablelimits="false">≤</mo><mtext>(c)</mtext></mover><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></munderover></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><mo>‖</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐆</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mo>‖</mo></mrow><msub><mn>𝟙</mn><mrow><mo maxsize="1.140em" minsize="1.140em">{</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>τ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo maxsize="1.140em" minsize="1.140em">}</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathop{\leq}\limits^{\text{(c)}}\eta_{n}\sum_{j=1}^{\tau_{n,m}}\sum_{s\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}w_{n,s}\left\|\mathbf{G}_{s,t-j-\tau_{n,s}}^{n}\right\|\mathbbm{1}_{\{t-j&gt;\tau_{n,s}\}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex47"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex47.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathop{\leq}\limits^{\text{(d)}}\eta_{n}\sum_{s\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\sum_{j=1}^{\min\{\tau_{n,m},t-\tau_{n,s}-1\}}w_{n,s}G_{s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover><mo movablelimits="false">≤</mo><mtext>(d)</mtext></mover><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.140em" minsize="1.140em">{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="1.140em" minsize="1.140em">}</mo></mrow></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathop{\leq}\limits^{\text{(d)}}\eta_{n}\sum_{s\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\sum_{j=1}^{\min\{\tau_{n,m},t-\tau_{n,s}-1\}}w_{n,s}G_{s}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.E2"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathop{\leq}\limits^{\text{(e)}}\eta_{n}K_{n}\sum_{s\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\min\{\tau_{n,m},t-\tau_{n,s}-1\}," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mover><mo movablelimits="false">≤</mo><mtext>(e)</mtext></mover><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>K</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathop{\leq}\limits^{\text{(e)}}\eta_{n}K_{n}\sum_{s\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\min\{\tau_{n,m},t-\tau_{n,s}-1\},</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(C-2)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A3.p1.2" class="ltx_p">where (a) and (c) hold by the triangle inequality,
(b) follows from <math id="A3.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left\|\Pi_{\mathcal{X}}[\mathbf{X}]-\mathbf{Y}\right\|^{2}\leq\left\|\mathbf{X}-\mathbf{Y}\right\|^{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">Π</mi><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒳</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>𝐗</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>𝐘</mi></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>≤</mo><msup><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mi>𝐗</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>𝐘</mi></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left\|\Pi_{\mathcal{X}}[\mathbf{X}]-\mathbf{Y}\right\|^{2}\leq\left\|\mathbf{X}-\mathbf{Y}\right\|^{2}</annotation></semantics></math> for <math id="A3.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{Y}\in\mathcal{X}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐘</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒳</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{Y}\in\mathcal{X}</annotation></semantics></math> <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib7" title="" class="ltx_ref">7</a>, Proposition 2.11]</cite>, (d) holds by the bounded gradient assumption,
and (e) follows from <math id="A3.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{j=1}^{\min\{a,b\}}c=\min\{a,b\}\times c" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.140em" minsize="1.140em">{</mo><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo maxsize="1.140em" minsize="1.140em">}</mo></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">{</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em" rspace="0.055em">}</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">×</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{j=1}^{\min\{a,b\}}c=\min\{a,b\}\times c</annotation></semantics></math>, with <math id="A3.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>c</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c</annotation></semantics></math> being a constant independent of <math id="A3.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>j</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j</annotation></semantics></math>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Substituting (<a href="#S5.E34" title="In V-B2 Bounding 𝙳𝚛𝚒𝚏𝚝_𝐗 ‣ V-B Bounding Individual Terms ‣ V Theoretical Analysis ‣ Distributed Dynamic Associative Memory via Online Convex Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">34</span></a>) into (<a href="#A3.E2" title="In Appendix C Proof of Bound on 𝙳𝚛𝚒𝚏𝚝_𝐗 ‣ Distributed Dynamic Associative Memory via Online Convex Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C-2</span></a>) gives</p>
<table id="A3.EGx16" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A3.Ex48"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex48.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathtt{Drift}_{\mathbf{X}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>𝙳𝚛𝚒𝚏𝚝</mi><mi>𝐗</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathtt{Drift}_{\mathbf{X}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex49"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex49.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\sum_{m\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}K_{n}^{2}\eta_{n}\sum_{t=\tau_{n,m}+1}^{T+\tau_{n,m}}\sum_{s\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\min\{\tau_{n,m},t-\tau_{n,s}-1\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>K</mi><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\sum_{m\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}K_{n}^{2}\eta_{n}\sum_{t=\tau_{n,m}+1}^{T+\tau_{n,m}}\sum_{s\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\min\{\tau_{n,m},t-\tau_{n,s}-1\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex50"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex50.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\sum_{t=\tau_{n,\min}+1}^{T+\tau_{n,\max}}\!\!\!\!K_{n}^{2}\eta_{n}\!\!\!\!\sum_{m\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\sum_{s\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\!\!\!\!\min\{\tau_{n,m},t\!-\!\tau_{n,s}\!-\!1\}\mathbbm{1}_{\{t&gt;\tau_{n,m}\}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>min</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>max</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></munderover></mstyle><msubsup><mi>K</mi><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mi>min</mi><mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">{</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0.052em" rspace="0.052em">−</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">}</mo></mrow><msub><mn>𝟙</mn><mrow><mo maxsize="1.140em" minsize="1.140em">{</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>τ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo maxsize="1.140em" minsize="1.140em">}</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\sum_{t=\tau_{n,\min}+1}^{T+\tau_{n,\max}}\!\!\!\!K_{n}^{2}\eta_{n}\!\!\!\!\sum_{m\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\sum_{s\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\!\!\!\!\min\{\tau_{n,m},t\!-\!\tau_{n,s}\!-\!1\}\mathbbm{1}_{\{t&gt;\tau_{n,m}\}}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex51"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex51.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{m\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\sum_{s\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\sum_{t=\tau_{n,m}+1}^{\tau_{n,s}+\tau_{n,m}}K_{n}^{2}\eta_{n}(t-\tau_{n,s}-1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>K</mi><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{m\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\sum_{s\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\sum_{t=\tau_{n,m}+1}^{\tau_{n,s}+\tau_{n,m}}K_{n}^{2}\eta_{n}(t-\tau_{n,s}-1)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex52"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex52.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002pt+\sum_{m\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\sum_{s\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\sum_{t=\tau_{n,s}+\tau_{n,m}+1}^{T+\tau_{n,\max}}K_{n}^{2}\eta_{n}\tau_{n,m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>max</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msup><mi>K</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>η</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub><mi>τ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002pt+\sum_{m\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\sum_{s\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\sum_{t=\tau_{n,s}+\tau_{n,m}+1}^{T+\tau_{n,\max}}K_{n}^{2}\eta_{n}\tau_{n,m}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.Ex53"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.Ex53.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{m\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\eta_{n}K_{n}^{2}\sum_{s\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\sum_{t=\tau_{n,m}+1}^{\tau_{n,s}+\tau_{n,m}}(t-\tau_{n,s}-1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>K</mi><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{m\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\eta_{n}K_{n}^{2}\sum_{s\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\sum_{t=\tau_{n,m}+1}^{\tau_{n,s}+\tau_{n,m}}(t-\tau_{n,s}-1)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A3.E3"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E3.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002pt+\sum_{m\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\tau_{n,m}K_{n}^{2}\sum_{s\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\sum_{t=\tau_{n,s}+\tau_{n,m}+1}^{T+\tau_{n,\max}}\eta_{n}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mi>τ</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mi>K</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></msub><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>max</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msup><mi>η</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002pt+\sum_{m\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\tau_{n,m}K_{n}^{2}\sum_{s\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\sum_{t=\tau_{n,s}+\tau_{n,m}+1}^{T+\tau_{n,\max}}\eta_{n}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(C-3)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p3.1" class="ltx_p">For the first term in the right side of (<a href="#A3.E3" title="In Appendix C Proof of Bound on 𝙳𝚛𝚒𝚏𝚝_𝐗 ‣ Distributed Dynamic Associative Memory via Online Convex Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C-3</span></a>), we have</p>
<table id="A3.E4" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A3.E4X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E4X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{s\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\sum_{t=\tau_{n,m}+1}^{\tau_{n,s}+\tau_{n,m}}(t-\tau_{n,s}-1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{s\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\sum_{t=\tau_{n,m}+1}^{\tau_{n,s}+\tau_{n,m}}(t-\tau_{n,s}-1)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="3" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(C-4)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.E4Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E4Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{s\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\frac{2\tau_{n,m}-\tau_{n,s}-1}{2}\tau_{n,s}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{s\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\frac{2\tau_{n,m}-\tau_{n,s}-1}{2}\tau_{n,s}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.E4Xb" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E4Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq|\mathcal{W}_{n}|\tau_{n,\max}^{2}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>max</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq|\mathcal{W}_{n}|\tau_{n,\max}^{2}.</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p4" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p4.1" class="ltx_p">For the second term in the right side of (<a href="#A3.E3" title="In Appendix C Proof of Bound on 𝙳𝚛𝚒𝚏𝚝_𝐗 ‣ Distributed Dynamic Associative Memory via Online Convex Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">C-3</span></a>), we have</p>
<table id="A3.E5" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody>
<tr id="A3.E5X" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E5X.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{s\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\sum_{t=\tau_{n,s}+\tau_{n,m}+1}^{T+\tau_{n,\max}}\eta_{n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>max</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{s\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\sum_{t=\tau_{n,s}+\tau_{n,m}+1}^{T+\tau_{n,\max}}\eta_{n}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E5X.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\sum_{s\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\sum_{t=\tau_{n,\min}}^{T+\tau_{n,\max}}\eta_{n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>min</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>max</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\sum_{s\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\sum_{t=\tau_{n,\min}}^{T+\tau_{n,\max}}\eta_{n}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="3" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equationgroup ltx_align_right">(C-5)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.E5Xa" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E5Xa.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=|\mathcal{W}_{n}|\sum_{t=\tau_{n,\min}+1}^{T+\tau_{n,\max}}\eta_{n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>min</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>max</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></munderover></mstyle><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=|\mathcal{W}_{n}|\sum_{t=\tau_{n,\min}+1}^{T+\tau_{n,\max}}\eta_{n}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A3.E5Xb" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A3.E5Xb.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=|\mathcal{W}_{n}|\eta_{n}\left(T+\Delta\tau_{n}\right)." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>η</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=|\mathcal{W}_{n}|\eta_{n}\left(T+\Delta\tau_{n}\right).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
</div>
<div id="A3.p5" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p5.1" class="ltx_p">Combining the above results, we complete this proof.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Proof of Lemma <a href="#Thmlemma2" title="Lemma 2. ‣ V-B3 Bounding 𝙳𝚛𝚒𝚏𝚝_𝐔 ‣ V-B Bounding Individual Terms ‣ V Theoretical Analysis ‣ Distributed Dynamic Associative Memory via Online Convex Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a></h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">By unfolding the difference <math id="A4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{U}_{n,t}-\mathbf{U}_{n,t-\tau_{n,m}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{U}_{n,t}-\mathbf{U}_{n,t-\tau_{n,m}}</annotation></semantics></math>, we obtain</p>
<table id="A4.EGx17" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_align ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody id="A4.Ex54"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.Ex54.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\sum_{t=\tau_{n,m}+1}^{T+\tau_{n,m}}\left\|\mathbf{U}_{n,t}-\mathbf{U}_{n,t-\tau_{n,m}}\right\|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\sum_{t=\tau_{n,m}+1}^{T+\tau_{n,m}}\left\|\mathbf{U}_{n,t}-\mathbf{U}_{n,t-\tau_{n,m}}\right\|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A4.Ex55"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.Ex55.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{t=\tau_{n,m}+1}^{T+\tau_{n,m}}\left\|\sum_{s=1}^{\tau_{n,m}}\left(\mathbf{U}_{n,t-s+1}-\mathbf{U}_{n,t-s}\right)\right\|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{t=\tau_{n,m}+1}^{T+\tau_{n,m}}\left\|\sum_{s=1}^{\tau_{n,m}}\left(\mathbf{U}_{n,t-s+1}-\mathbf{U}_{n,t-s}\right)\right\|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A4.Ex56"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.Ex56.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\leq\sum_{t=\tau_{n,m}+1}^{T+\tau_{n,m}}\sum_{s=1}^{\tau_{n,m}}\left\|\mathbf{U}_{n,t-s+1}-\mathbf{U}_{n,t-s}\right\|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></munderover></mstyle><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\leq\sum_{t=\tau_{n,m}+1}^{T+\tau_{n,m}}\sum_{s=1}^{\tau_{n,m}}\left\|\mathbf{U}_{n,t-s+1}-\mathbf{U}_{n,t-s}\right\|</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
<tbody id="A4.E1"><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A4.E1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle=\sum_{t=2}^{T+\tau_{n,m}}\xi_{n,m}^{t}\left\|\mathbf{U}_{n,t}-\mathbf{U}_{n,t-1}\right\|," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mphantom></mphantom><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munderover><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></munderover></mstyle><mrow><msubsup><mi>ξ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>‖</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>𝐔</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>‖</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle=\sum_{t=2}^{T+\tau_{n,m}}\xi_{n,m}^{t}\left\|\mathbf{U}_{n,t}-\mathbf{U}_{n,t-1}\right\|,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(D-1)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A4.p1.2" class="ltx_p">where</p>
<table id="A4.E2" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A4.E2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\xi_{n,m}^{t}=\left\{\begin{array}[]{ll}t-1,&amp;2\leq t\leq\tau_{n,m}\\
\tau_{n,m},&amp;\tau_{n,m}&lt;t&lt;T\\
T+\tau_{n,m}-t+1,&amp;T\leq t\leq T+\tau_{n,m}\\
\end{array}\right.." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>ξ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>{</mo><mtable columnspacing="5pt" displaystyle="true" rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>,</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd class="ltx_align_left" columnalign="left"><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable><mphantom></mphantom></mrow></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\xi_{n,m}^{t}=\left\{\begin{array}[]{ll}t-1,&amp;2\leq t\leq\tau_{n,m}\\
\tau_{n,m},&amp;\tau_{n,m}&lt;t&lt;T\\
T+\tau_{n,m}-t+1,&amp;T\leq t\leq T+\tau_{n,m}\\
\end{array}\right..</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(D-2)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A4.p1.3" class="ltx_p">Since <math id="A4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\xi_{n,m}^{t}\leq\tau_{n,m}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>ξ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mi>t</mi></msubsup><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\xi_{n,m}^{t}\leq\tau_{n,m}</annotation></semantics></math> for all <math id="A4.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>t</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t</annotation></semantics></math>, we complete this proof.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>Combinatorial Optimization-based Tree Design</h2>

<div id="A5.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Building on the above design principles, we formulate an optimization problem tailored to our specific design objectives.
This formulation is grounded in a flow-conservation-based approach, which accurately models the connectivity requirements and the path-dependent cost characteristics described below:</p>
<table id="A5.E1" class="ltx_equationgroup ltx_eqn_table">
<tbody><tr id="A5.EGx18" class="ltx_eqn_row"><td class="ltx_eqn_cell" colspan="5"></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.E1.1" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E1.1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\min_{\begin{subarray}{c}h_{i,j}\in\{0,1\},\;v_{i}\in\{0,1\}\\
C_{i,j}^{w}\geq 0,\;C^{\text{conn}}_{i,j}\geq 0\end{subarray}}\mathrm{Dist}=\sum_{w\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\sum_{(i,j)\in\mathcal{E}}\!\!\!\tau_{i,j}\left(C_{i,j}^{w}+C_{j,i}^{w}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><munder><mi>min</mi><mtable rowspacing="0pt"><mtr><mtd><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.140em" minsize="1.140em">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo maxsize="1.140em" minsize="1.140em">}</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.387em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="1.140em" minsize="1.140em">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo maxsize="1.140em" minsize="1.140em">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mi>w</mi></msubsup><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo rspace="0.387em">,</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mtext>conn</mtext></msubsup><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mrow></mtd></mtr></mtable></munder><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi>Dist</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mi>w</mi></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi>w</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\min_{\begin{subarray}{c}h_{i,j}\in\{0,1\},\;v_{i}\in\{0,1\}\\
C_{i,j}^{w}\geq 0,\;C^{\text{conn}}_{i,j}\geq 0\end{subarray}}\mathrm{Dist}=\sum_{w\in\mathcal{W}_{n}}\sum_{(i,j)\in\mathcal{E}}\!\!\!\tau_{i,j}\left(C_{i,j}^{w}+C_{j,i}^{w}\right)</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(E-1a)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.E1.2" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E1.2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\mathrm{s.t.}\;\;v_{w}=1,\hskip 10.00002pt\forall w\in\mathcal{W}_{n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">.</mo><mi>t</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.607em">.</mo><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\mathrm{s.t.}\;\;v_{w}=1,\hskip 10.00002pt\forall w\in\mathcal{W}_{n}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(E-1b)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.E1.3" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E1.3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002pt\sum_{(i,j)\in\mathcal{E}}h_{i,j}=\sum_{i\in\mathcal{N}}v_{i}-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi></mrow></munder></mstyle><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002pt\sum_{(i,j)\in\mathcal{E}}h_{i,j}=\sum_{i\in\mathcal{N}}v_{i}-1</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(E-1c)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.E1.4" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E1.4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002pth_{i,j}\leq v_{i},\hskip 10.00002pth_{i,j}\leq v_{j},\;\forall(i,j)\in\mathcal{E}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.387em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>∀</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002pth_{i,j}\leq v_{i},\hskip 10.00002pth_{i,j}\leq v_{j},\;\forall(i,j)\in\mathcal{E}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(E-1d)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.E1.5" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E1.5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002ptC_{i,j}^{w}+C_{j,i}^{w}\leq h_{i,j},\;\forall w\in\mathcal{W}_{n}\setminus\{n\},\;\forall(i,j)\in\mathcal{E}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mi>w</mi></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mi>w</mi></msubsup></mrow><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mo rspace="0.387em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>∖</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">{</mo><mi>n</mi><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.387em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>∀</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002ptC_{i,j}^{w}+C_{j,i}^{w}\leq h_{i,j},\;\forall w\in\mathcal{W}_{n}\setminus\{n\},\;\forall(i,j)\in\mathcal{E}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(E-1e)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.E1.6" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E1.6.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002pt\sum_{j:(n,j)\in\mathcal{E}}\!\!\!C_{n,j}^{w}\!-\!\!\!\!\sum_{j:(j,n)\in\mathcal{E}}\!\!\!C_{j,n}^{w}=1,\;\forall w\in\mathcal{W}_{n}\setminus\{n\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi></mrow></mrow></munder></mstyle><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mi>w</mi></msubsup><mpadded style="width:0.292em;" width="0.292em"><mo>−</mo></mpadded><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi></mrow></mrow></munder></mstyle><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mi>w</mi></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo rspace="0.387em">,</mo><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>∖</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">{</mo><mi>n</mi><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002pt\sum_{j:(n,j)\in\mathcal{E}}\!\!\!C_{n,j}^{w}\!-\!\!\!\!\sum_{j:(j,n)\in\mathcal{E}}\!\!\!C_{j,n}^{w}=1,\;\forall w\in\mathcal{W}_{n}\setminus\{n\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(E-1f)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.E1.7" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E1.7.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002pt\sum_{j:(w,j)\in\mathcal{E}}\!\!\!C_{w,j}^{w}\!-\!\!\!\!\sum_{j:(j,w)\in\mathcal{E}}\!\!\!C_{j,w}^{w}=-1,\;\forall w\in\mathcal{W}_{n}\setminus\!\{n\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi></mrow></mrow></munder></mstyle><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mi>w</mi></msubsup><mpadded style="width:0.292em;" width="0.292em"><mo>−</mo></mpadded><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi></mrow></mrow></munder></mstyle><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow><mi>w</mi></msubsup><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo rspace="0.387em">,</mo><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.052em">∖</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">{</mo><mi>n</mi><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002pt\sum_{j:(w,j)\in\mathcal{E}}\!\!\!C_{w,j}^{w}\!-\!\!\!\!\sum_{j:(j,w)\in\mathcal{E}}\!\!\!C_{j,w}^{w}=-1,\;\forall w\in\mathcal{W}_{n}\setminus\!\{n\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(E-1g)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.E1.x1" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E1.x1.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002pt\sum_{j:(i,j)\in\mathcal{E}}\!\!\!C_{i,j}^{w}\!-\!\!\!\!\sum_{j:(j,i)\in\mathcal{E}}\!\!\!C_{j,i}^{w}=0," display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mi>C</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>w</mi></msup><mpadded style="width:0.292em;" width="0.292em"><mo>−</mo></mpadded><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mi>C</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mrow></mrow><mi>w</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002pt\sum_{j:(i,j)\in\mathcal{E}}\!\!\!C_{i,j}^{w}\!-\!\!\!\!\sum_{j:(j,i)\in\mathcal{E}}\!\!\!C_{j,i}^{w}=0,</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.E1.8" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E1.8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\hskip 20.00003pt\hskip 20.00003pt\hskip 20.00003pt\hskip 20.00003pt\hskip 10.00002pt\forall w\in\mathcal{W}_{n}\setminus\{n\},\;\forall i\notin\{n,w\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mrow><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>∖</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">{</mo><mi>n</mi><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.387em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>∉</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">{</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>w</mi><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hskip 20.00003pt\hskip 20.00003pt\hskip 20.00003pt\hskip 20.00003pt\hskip 10.00002pt\forall w\in\mathcal{W}_{n}\setminus\{n\},\;\forall i\notin\{n,w\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(E-1h)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.E1.9" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E1.9.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002pt\sum_{j:(n,j)\in\mathcal{E}}\!\!\!C^{\text{conn}}_{n,j}\!-\!\!\!\!\sum_{j:(j,n)\in\mathcal{E}}\!\!\!C^{\text{conn}}_{j,n}=\sum_{i\in\mathcal{N}}v_{i}-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mi>C</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mtext>conn</mtext></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mpadded style="width:0.292em;" width="0.292em"><mo>−</mo></mpadded><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi></mrow></mrow></msub><mi>C</mi><msup><mrow></mrow><mtext>conn</mtext></msup><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle="true"><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo></mstyle><msub><mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi></mrow></msub><mi>v</mi><msub><mrow></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002pt\sum_{j:(n,j)\in\mathcal{E}}\!\!\!C^{\text{conn}}_{n,j}\!-\!\!\!\!\sum_{j:(j,n)\in\mathcal{E}}\!\!\!C^{\text{conn}}_{j,n}=\sum_{i\in\mathcal{N}}v_{i}-1</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(E-1i)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.E1.10" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E1.10.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002pt\sum_{j:(j,i)\in\mathcal{E}}\!\!\!C^{\text{conn}}_{j,i}\!-\!\!\!\!\sum_{j:(i,j)\in\mathcal{E}}\!\!\!C^{\text{conn}}_{i,j}=v_{i},\;\forall i\in\mathcal{N}\setminus\{n\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi></mrow></mrow></munder></mstyle><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mtext>conn</mtext></msubsup><mpadded style="width:0.292em;" width="0.292em"><mo>−</mo></mpadded><mstyle displaystyle="true"><munder><mo movablelimits="false">∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi></mrow></mrow></munder></mstyle><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mtext>conn</mtext></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo rspace="0.387em">,</mo><mo rspace="0.167em">∀</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo>∖</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">{</mo><mi>n</mi><mo maxsize="0.800em" minsize="0.800em">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002pt\sum_{j:(j,i)\in\mathcal{E}}\!\!\!C^{\text{conn}}_{j,i}\!-\!\!\!\!\sum_{j:(i,j)\in\mathcal{E}}\!\!\!C^{\text{conn}}_{i,j}=v_{i},\;\forall i\in\mathcal{N}\setminus\{n\}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(E-1j)</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.E1.11" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_eqn_cell"></td>
<td class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_eqn_cell"><math id="A5.E1.11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002ptC^{\text{conn}}_{i,j}\!\leq\!|\mathcal{N}|\cdot h_{i,j},\;C^{\text{conn}}_{j,i}\!\leq\!|\mathcal{N}|\cdot h_{i,j},\;\forall(i,j)\in\mathcal{E}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mtext>conn</mtext></msubsup><mo lspace="0.108em" rspace="0.108em">≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.387em">,</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mtext>conn</mtext></msubsup><mo rspace="0.108em">≤</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi><mo rspace="0.055em" stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.387em">,</mo><mrow><mrow><mo>∀</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℰ</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\displaystyle\hskip 10.00002ptC^{\text{conn}}_{i,j}\!\leq\!|\mathcal{N}|\cdot h_{i,j},\;C^{\text{conn}}_{j,i}\!\leq\!|\mathcal{N}|\cdot h_{i,j},\;\forall(i,j)\in\mathcal{E}</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td>
<td rowspan="1" class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_eqno ltx_align_middle ltx_align_right"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_equation ltx_align_right">(E-1k)</span></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="A5.p1.2" class="ltx_p">where binary variable <math id="A5.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="h_{i,j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>h</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">h_{i,j}</annotation></semantics></math> indicates whether edge <math id="A5.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(i,j)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(i,j)</annotation></semantics></math> is selected in the resulting tree, and <math id="A5.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="v_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">v_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> indicates whether node <math id="A5.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math> is included.
The auxiliary flow variable <math id="A5.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{i,j}^{w}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mi>w</mi></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{i,j}^{w}</annotation></semantics></math> captures the unit-demand routing from the root node <math id="A5.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math> to each target node <math id="A5.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="w\in\mathcal{W}_{n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo>∈</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒲</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">w\in\mathcal{W}_{n}</annotation></semantics></math> and contributes to the cost function in (<a href="#A5.E1.1" title="In E-1 ‣ Appendix E Combinatorial Optimization-based Tree Design ‣ Distributed Dynamic Associative Memory via Online Convex Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E-1a</span></a>).
Constraints (<a href="#A5.E1.2" title="In E-1 ‣ Appendix E Combinatorial Optimization-based Tree Design ‣ Distributed Dynamic Associative Memory via Online Convex Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E-1b</span></a>)–(<a href="#A5.E1.5" title="In E-1 ‣ Appendix E Combinatorial Optimization-based Tree Design ‣ Distributed Dynamic Associative Memory via Online Convex Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E-1e</span></a>) enforce the tree structure and edge-node consistency.
Flow conservation for each demand is captured in (<a href="#A5.E1.6" title="In E-1 ‣ Appendix E Combinatorial Optimization-based Tree Design ‣ Distributed Dynamic Associative Memory via Online Convex Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E-1f</span></a>)–(<a href="#A5.E1.8" title="In E-1 ‣ Appendix E Combinatorial Optimization-based Tree Design ‣ Distributed Dynamic Associative Memory via Online Convex Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E-1h</span></a>).
To ensure global connectivity of the tree, an auxiliary flow variable <math id="A5.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C^{\text{conn}}_{i,j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mtext>conn</mtext></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C^{\text{conn}}_{i,j}</annotation></semantics></math> is introduced.
This variable simulates pushing <math id="A5.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sum_{n\in\mathcal{N}}v_{i}-1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒩</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sum_{n\in\mathcal{N}}v_{i}-1</annotation></semantics></math> units of flow from the root to all active nodes.
Constraint (<a href="#A5.E1.9" title="In E-1 ‣ Appendix E Combinatorial Optimization-based Tree Design ‣ Distributed Dynamic Associative Memory via Online Convex Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E-1i</span></a>) initiates the global flow from the root,
(<a href="#A5.E1.10" title="In E-1 ‣ Appendix E Combinatorial Optimization-based Tree Design ‣ Distributed Dynamic Associative Memory via Online Convex Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E-1j</span></a>) ensures each activated node receives exactly one unit of flow,
and (<a href="#A5.E1.11" title="In E-1 ‣ Appendix E Combinatorial Optimization-based Tree Design ‣ Distributed Dynamic Associative Memory via Online Convex Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E-1k</span></a>) restricts global flow to edges that are less than predefined threshold <math id="A5.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|\mathcal{G}|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒢</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|\mathcal{G}|</annotation></semantics></math>, which guarantees that all activated nodes are connected within a single tree structure.</p>
</div>
<div id="A5.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.p2.1" class="ltx_p">This problem (<a href="#A5.E1" title="In Appendix E Combinatorial Optimization-based Tree Design ‣ Distributed Dynamic Associative Memory via Online Convex Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">E-1</span></a>) is formulated as a mixed integer programming problem, which can be solved by existing solvers, like PuLP, and Gurobi.</p>
</div>
</section>
